{
  "uid": "lab5g-overview",
  "title": "lab5g — Estado de la red 5G",
  "tags": ["lab5g", "free5gc"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Plano de control",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Alcanzabilidad de los NF (TCP)",
      "description": "probe_success del job blackbox-sbi-tcp. 1 = el puerto SBI acepta conexiones. Si el NRF esta caido, todos los demas caen detras.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "probe_success{plane=\"control\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "CAIDO", "color": "red", "index": 0 } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "1": { "text": "OK", "color": "green", "index": 1 } } }
          ],
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 } ] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latencia de conexion al SBI",
      "description": "probe_duration_seconds: cuanto tarda el TCP handshake contra cada NF. Un crecimiento sostenido suele ser saturacion de disco del host, no de la red.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "probe_duration_seconds{plane=\"control\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "s", "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 8 } },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Plano de usuario — tunel del UE",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 7 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "uesimtun0 activo",
      "description": "ue_tunnel_up lo empuja iperf-probe.sh al pushgateway. 1 = la interfaz existe con IP del pool 10.60.0.0/16. Es la senal de que el registro NAS y la sesion PDU funcionaron.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "ue_tunnel_up", "legendFormat": "{{instance}}", "instant": true }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "SIN TUNEL", "color": "red", "index": 0 } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "1": { "text": "ARRIBA", "color": "green", "index": 1 } } }
          ],
          "noValue": "sin datos"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "ICMP desde el UE al Data Network",
      "description": "probe_success del job blackbox-ue-icmp. Blackbox vive en el netns del UE, asi que esto mide de verdad el trafico GTP-U de extremo a extremo: UE -> gNB -> UPF -> DN.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "probe_success{plane=\"user\"}", "legendFormat": "{{instance}}", "instant": true }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "SIN PASO", "color": "red", "index": 0 } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "1": { "text": "OK", "color": "green", "index": 1 } } }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latencia a traves de uesimtun0",
      "description": "RTT ICMP medido desde el UE. Incluye la encapsulacion GTP-U completa.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "probe_icmp_duration_seconds{plane=\"user\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}} — {{phase}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "s", "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 8 } },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Throughput por el tunel (iperf3)",
      "description": "Lo empuja iperf-probe.sh cada INTERVAL segundos (300 por defecto), asi que la serie es escalonada, no continua. Si el UL/DL se hunde mientras el ICMP sigue OK, sospecha del MTU: UE_MTU debe ser DOCKER_MTU menos 36 bytes de cabecera GTP-U.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "ue_throughput_downlink_bps", "legendFormat": "downlink" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "ue_throughput_uplink_bps", "legendFormat": "uplink" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "bps", "custom": { "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "spanNulls": true } },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Recursos",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 20 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU por contenedor del lab",
      "description": "cadvisor, con metric_relabel_configs que deja solo los contenedores del lab para bajar cardinalidad.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 21 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (name) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{name!=\"\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "percentunit", "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 8 } },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memoria por contenedor del lab",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 21 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (name) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{name!=\"\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "bytes", "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 8 } },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Espera de I/O del LXC",
      "description": "Panel deliberado: en este host el I/O es el cuello de botella real. Un iowait alto explica arranques lentos, healthchecks que expiran y falsos fallos de PFCP o NGAP que parecen de configuracion.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 28 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "avg(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"iowait\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "iowait"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "avg(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"system\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "system"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "avg(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"user\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "user"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "percentunit", "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 8, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } } },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memoria y swap del LXC",
      "description": "El swap en uso es la senal temprana de que el host esta sobrecomprometido: precede a los arranques lentos y a los timeouts.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 28 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "node_memory_MemTotal_bytes - node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes",
          "legendFormat": "en uso"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "node_memory_SwapTotal_bytes - node_memory_SwapFree_bytes",
          "legendFormat": "swap en uso"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "bytes", "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 8 } },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Capa fisica y teoria de la informacion (simulado — notebook UD.Lab2.TeoriaInformacion)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 35 },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Potencia de Tx elegida por el agente Q-Learning",
      "description": "lab5g_phy_tx_power_dbm. Accion discreta del agente (5, 15, 25, 35, 43 dBm) por slice. Lo empuja phy-sim, adaptado de NetworkConfig.POWER_LEVELS_DBM del notebook.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 36 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "expr": "lab5g_phy_tx_power_dbm", "legendFormat": "{{slice}}" } ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 8 } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Perdidas de trayectoria (FSPL)",
      "description": "lab5g_phy_path_loss_db. PL_dB = 20*log10(d_km) + 20*log10(f_MHz) + 32.44, funcion free_space_path_loss_db() del notebook.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 36 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "expr": "lab5g_phy_path_loss_db", "legendFormat": "{{slice}}" } ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 8 } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Distancia UE-estacion base simulada",
      "description": "lab5g_phy_distance_m. Distancia base por estado de canal (CHANNEL_STATE_DISTANCES_M, 50-2000 m) mas fading Rayleigh.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 36 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "expr": "lab5g_phy_distance_m", "legendFormat": "{{slice}}" } ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "lengthm", "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 8 } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Calidad de senal: SNR / SIR / SINR",
      "description": "compute_snr_sir_sinr_db() del notebook. SNR = Prx/N, SIR = Prx/I, SINR = Prx/(N+I), en dB.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 43 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "lab5g_phy_snr_db", "legendFormat": "{{slice}} SNR" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "lab5g_phy_sir_db", "legendFormat": "{{slice}} SIR" },
        { "refId": "C", "expr": "lab5g_phy_sinr_db", "legendFormat": "{{slice}} SINR" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 8 } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Velocidad: throughput (SINR) vs capacidad teorica (SNR)",
      "description": "lab5g_phy_throughput_mbps (Shannon-Hartley con SINR, trafico real esperado) vs lab5g_phy_capacity_theoretical_mbps (Shannon-Hartley con SNR puro, cota superior sin interferencia).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 43 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "lab5g_phy_throughput_mbps", "legendFormat": "{{slice}} throughput" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "lab5g_phy_capacity_theoretical_mbps", "legendFormat": "{{slice}} capacidad teorica" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "Mbits", "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 8 } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latencia total vs SLA objetivo por slice",
      "description": "lab5g_phy_latency_ms = propagacion (distancia/c) + transmision, comparada contra lab5g_phy_latency_sla_target_ms (10 ms eMBB, 1 ms URLLC, 20 ms mMTC).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 50 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "lab5g_phy_latency_ms", "legendFormat": "{{slice}} latencia" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "lab5g_phy_latency_sla_target_ms", "legendFormat": "{{slice}} SLA objetivo" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ms", "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 8 } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Entropia de la fuente H(f) por slice",
      "description": "lab5g_info_entropy_bits_per_symbol. H(f) = sum(P_k * -log2(P_k)), segun la distribucion Zipf de cada slice (K simbolos, sesgo). Bonus de Teoria de la Informacion sobre el enunciado de parametros de red.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 50 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "expr": "lab5g_info_entropy_bits_per_symbol", "legendFormat": "{{slice}}", "instant": true } ],
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": true }, "colorMode": "value", "textMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "decimals": 3 }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Tasa de informacion requerida R = H(f) * Rs",
      "description": "lab5g_info_required_rate_mbps. Tasa de informacion de la fuente de cada slice, en las mismas unidades que la capacidad de canal C para poder comparar R <= C.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 50 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "expr": "lab5g_info_required_rate_mbps", "legendFormat": "{{slice}}", "instant": true } ],
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": true }, "colorMode": "value", "textMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "Mbits", "decimals": 2 }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Ganancia de antena (dBi)",
      "description": "lab5g_phy_antenna_gain_tx_dbi / lab5g_phy_antenna_gain_rx_dbi. Constantes de NetworkConfig: estacion base sectorial (Tx) vs equipo de usuario (Rx). Filtradas a un slice para no repetir valores.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 57 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "lab5g_phy_antenna_gain_tx_dbi{slice=\"eMBB\"}", "legendFormat": "Tx (estacion base)", "instant": true },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "lab5g_phy_antenna_gain_rx_dbi{slice=\"eMBB\"}", "legendFormat": "Rx (UE)", "instant": true }
      ],
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": true }, "colorMode": "value", "textMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": {}, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Ancho de banda del canal",
      "description": "lab5g_phy_bandwidth_mhz, segun el escenario activo en ESCENARIOS_CANAL (nominal=20 MHz, banda_estrecha=5 MHz, mmwave_n258=100 MHz).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 57 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "expr": "lab5g_phy_bandwidth_mhz{slice=\"eMBB\"}", "legendFormat": "{{escenario}}", "instant": true } ],
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "colorMode": "value", "textMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "MHz" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Frecuencia de portadora / banda 3GPP",
      "description": "lab5g_phy_frequency_mhz. Banda 3GPP TS 38.101-1 asociada al escenario activo (n1=2100 MHz, n78=3500 MHz, n258=26000 MHz mmWave).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 57 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "expr": "lab5g_phy_frequency_mhz{slice=\"eMBB\"}", "legendFormat": "{{band}}", "instant": true } ],
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "colorMode": "value", "textMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "MHz" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Cumple criterio de Shannon (R <= C)",
      "description": "lab5g_info_meets_shannon_criterion, por slice. 1 = la tasa de informacion requerida por la fuente cabe en la capacidad teorica del canal (comunicacion sin perdida).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 57 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "expr": "lab5g_info_meets_shannon_criterion", "legendFormat": "{{slice}}", "instant": true } ],
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": true }, "colorMode": "background", "textMode": "auto", "orientation": "auto" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "NO CUMPLE", "color": "red", "index": 0 } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "1": { "text": "OK", "color": "green", "index": 1 } } }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Estandares tecnicos y formulas de referencia",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 63 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Fuente:** `Actividad_2.ipynb` (UD.Lab2.TeoriaInformacion) — simulado por `phy-sim`, no medido de la red real (free5GC/UERANSIM no tienen RF).\n\n| Banda 3GPP (TS 38.101-1) | Frecuencia | Uso tipico |\n|---|---|---|\n| n1 | 2100 MHz | FDD, banda baja, buena cobertura |\n| n78 | 3500 MHz | TDD, banda media, 5G NR mas usada (escenario `nominal`) |\n| n258 | 26000 MHz | mmWave, alta capacidad / corto alcance (escenario `mmwave_n258`) |\n\n- **FSPL:** `PL_dB = 20*log10(d_km) + 20*log10(f_MHz) + 32.44`\n- **Balance de enlace:** `Prx = Ptx + Gt + Gr - PL` (dBm)\n- **Shannon-Hartley:** `C = B * log2(1 + S/N)` — throughput con SINR, capacidad teorica con SNR puro\n- **Criterio de comunicacion sin perdida:** `R = H(f) * Rs <= C`\n- **Entropia de la fuente:** `H(f) = sum(P_k * -log2(P_k))` bits/simbolo; extension de bloque `H(f^N) = N * H(f)`"
      },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": {}, "overrides": [] }
    }
  ]
}
